    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux Security Module (LSM) Framework",
      "source_hash": 3618211307197661703,
      "context_hash": 16204545117330926485,
      "translation": "Linux Security Module(LSM) 프레임워크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419360Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's hook-based Mandatory Access Control infrastructure",
      "source_hash": 17025082674903382085,
      "context_hash": 17290395545208742034,
      "translation": "커널의 훅 기반 강제적 접근 제어(Mandatory Access Control) 인프라",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hook": "훅",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What LSM is",
      "source_hash": 16012297867700034651,
      "context_hash": 6973187095407319467,
      "translation": "LSM이란",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Linux Security Module framework (introduced in Linux 2.6.0, December 2003) provides a set of hooks throughout the kernel where security modules can enforce additional access controls beyond standard DAC.",
      "source_hash": 16445531913213189762,
      "context_hash": 16911932229314843402,
      "translation": "Linux Security Module 프레임워크(Linux 2.6.0, 2003년 12월 도입)는 커널 전반에 걸쳐 훅 집합을 제공하며, 보안 모듈은 이 훅에서 표준 DAC 이상의 추가 접근 제어를 적용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "hooks": "훅",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "module": "모듈",
        "modules": "모듈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Designed by Crispin Cowan (WireX) with NSA, SGI, and others — presented at USENIX Security 2002: [\"Linux Security Modules: General Security Support for the Linux Kernel\"](https://www.usenix.org/conference/11th-usenix-security-symposium/linux-security-modules-general-security-support-linux).",
      "source_hash": 5837566449588011847,
      "context_hash": 8194081175648920449,
      "translation": "Crispin Cowan(WireX)이 NSA, SGI 등과 함께 설계했으며, USENIX Security 2002에서 발표되었습니다: [\"Linux Security Modules: General Security Support for the Linux Kernel\"](https://www.usenix.org/conference/11th-usenix-security-symposium/linux-security-modules-general-security-support-linux).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Kernel docs: [security/lsm.html](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/security/lsm.html).",
      "source_hash": 5210264105922785273,
      "context_hash": 10901206313597714481,
      "translation": "커널 문서: [security/lsm.html](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/security/lsm.html).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Kernel docs": "커널 문서"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "LSM hooks are called at security-critical points:",
      "source_hash": 2578290947859992131,
      "context_hash": 15516449235735587230,
      "translation": "LSM 훅은 보안상 중요한 지점에서 호출됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hooks": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419361Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
