      "source_hash": 3391659874965738424,
      "context_hash": 12650657688243804691,
      "translation": "IPC 연산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Capability checks",
      "source_hash": 9770358829414136026,
      "context_hash": 6229617698453238391,
      "translation": "capability 검사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Multiple LSMs can be active simultaneously (stacking, since Linux 4.2 — [`3c4ed7bdf599`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/3c4ed7bdf5997d8020cbb8d4abbef2fcfb9f1284) by Casey Schaufler).",
      "source_hash": 7381764023721205311,
      "context_hash": 18174130600652602656,
      "translation": "여러 LSM이 동시에 활성화될 수 있습니다(스태킹, Linux 4.2부터 — Casey Schaufler의 [`3c4ed7bdf599`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/3c4ed7bdf5997d8020cbb8d4abbef2fcfb9f1284)).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel evaluates all of them: access is granted only if ALL LSMs allow it.",
      "source_hash": 3540784852142770256,
      "context_hash": 15499866030524274135,
      "translation": "커널은 이들 모두를 평가하며, 모든 LSM이 허용하는 경우에만 접근이 허용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "LSM hook architecture",
      "source_hash": 7997242733707429628,
      "context_hash": 9559750472677792595,
      "translation": "LSM 훅 아키텍처",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
