    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SELinux",
      "source_hash": 12021188644168258033,
      "context_hash": 855397183156665039,
      "translation": "SELinux",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SELinux": "SELinux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "SELinux (Security-Enhanced Linux) was developed by the NSA, open-sourced in December 2000, and merged into Linux 2.6.0-test3 (August 2003).",
      "source_hash": 8310638380472436936,
      "context_hash": 2573039895365031481,
      "translation": "SELinux(Security-Enhanced Linux)는 NSA가 개발하여 2000년 12월에 오픈 소스로 공개했으며, Linux 2.6.0-test3(2003년 8월)에 병합되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "SELinux": "SELinux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It implements Mandatory Access Control based on **labels** and **policies**.",
      "source_hash": 10129930623526701616,
      "context_hash": 4396777278449893403,
      "translation": "SELinux는 **레이블**과 **정책**에 기반한 강제적 접근 제어를 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policies": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Labels",
      "source_hash": 7116271246533036431,
      "context_hash": 5424390131459204596,
      "translation": "레이블",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Every object (file, process, socket) has a security context:",
      "source_hash": 12570066610595458016,
      "context_hash": 1225937678732963042,
      "translation": "모든 객체(파일, 프로세스, 소켓)는 보안 컨텍스트를 가집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Policy",
      "source_hash": 15600915023236860189,
      "context_hash": 11827448919581047861,
      "translation": "정책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The policy defines which types can perform which operations on which other types:",
      "source_hash": 5717281749687076745,
      "context_hash": 14316429522901005542,
      "translation": "정책은 어떤 타입이 어떤 다른 타입에 대해 어떤 연산을 수행할 수 있는지를 정의합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "SELinux internals",
      "source_hash": 17786989321691222941,
      "context_hash": 9579928266369834062,
      "translation": "SELinux 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SELinux": "SELinux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "AppArmor",
      "source_hash": 4042063843493869819,
      "context_hash": 12662975963601435099,
      "translation": "AppArmor",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "AppArmor (originally \"SubDomain\" by Immunix, 1998; maintained by Canonical since 2009) was merged into Linux 2.6.36 (October 2010) by John Johansen — [`b5e95b48685e`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b5e95b48685e3481139a5634d14d630d12c7d5ce).",
      "source_hash": 16082154130410403047,
      "context_hash": 8335795085518578676,
      "translation": "AppArmor(원래 Immunix의 \"SubDomain\", 1998년; 2009년부터 Canonical이 유지 관리)는 John Johansen에 의해 Linux 2.6.36(2010년 10월)에 병합되었습니다 — [`b5e95b48685e`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b5e95b48685e3481139a5634d14d630d12c7d5ce).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It uses **path-based** MAC — simpler than SELinux's label model.",
      "source_hash": 87441085725934659,
      "context_hash": 8347557422350576808,
      "translation": "AppArmor는 **경로 기반** MAC을 사용하며, 이는 SELinux의 레이블 모델보다 단순합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SELinux": "SELinux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Profiles are plain text and specify what a program can do:",
      "source_hash": 2270542902147788008,
      "context_hash": 11881244351429343394,
      "translation": "프로파일은 일반 텍스트이며 프로그램이 무엇을 할 수 있는지를 지정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "AppArmor internals",
      "source_hash": 192676974894707064,
      "context_hash": 6636709205381507825,
      "translation": "AppArmor 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "AppArmor stores profiles as finite automata (DFA/HFA) for efficient path matching:",
      "source_hash": 4327804217441120335,
      "context_hash": 17509331803741959288,
      "translation": "AppArmor는 효율적인 경로 매칭을 위해 프로파일을 유한 오토마타(DFA/HFA)로 저장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:15.419363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
